  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F/200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lively olive oil, grill seasoning, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the sliced argentinian potatoes to the bowl and toss to coat with the mixture.",
    "Grill the potatoes for 5-7 minutes per side, or until tender and slightly charred.",
    "Transfer the potatoes to a serving platter and sprinkle with minced garlic and chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve hot with lime wedges on the side."
